1,"Sénoufo, Supyire Language (SPP)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/spp/,Supyire Sénoufo is a stable indigenous language of Mali. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Sénoufo, Supyire",Niger-Congo
